- Added catchable `time.parse` refusal tests for offsets that push both calendar edges out of range.
- Added the positive out-of-window `time.unix(time.parse("+10001-01-01"))` refusal.
- Corrected the `SURVEY.md` citation to `src/runtime.rs:1708`.
- Updated `seconds_for_format` docs to describe fractional truncation toward zero.

All four gates pass: `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test --all-targets` (2280 passed), and `../rbops/verify.sh phase-097`.
